cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: clawtouch-hid
abstract: >-
  Open USB-CDC HID firmware and a byte-level frozen wire protocol for the
  ClawTouch hardware: a Raspberry Pi Pico 2 that turns framed serial commands
  into standard USB HID keyboard and mouse reports. Includes the canonical
  clawtouch-hid-protocol Python package.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Beijing Tinqiao Technology Co., Ltd."
    website: "https://clawtouch.cn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tinqiao-oss/clawtouch-hid"
url: "https://github.com/tinqiao-oss/clawtouch-hid"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - HID
  - USB-CDC
  - CircuitPython
  - wire-protocol
  - RP2350
  - automation
